      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  /* square cards keep the top of tall model pictures, so heads are never cut off (Andy, 19 Oct 2026) */\n  .collection-list .card__media img { object-position: center top; }\n  /* card text: one short line, not the full collection text */\n  .collection-list .card__caption { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"page-width page-width--narrow search-modal__form\" style=\"margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;\">\n  <form action=\"{{ routes.search_url }}\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\" class=\"search\">\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <input \n        class=\"search__input field__input\"\n        id=\"Search-In-Page\"\n        type=\"search\"\n        name=\"q\"\n        value=\"{{ search.terms | escape }}\"\n        placeholder=\"Search products...\"\n      >\n      <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"Search-In-Page\">Search products...</label>\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"type\" value=\"product\">\n      <button class=\"search__button field__button\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n        <svg class=\"icon icon-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width: 2rem; height: 2rem;\">\n          <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11.03 11.68A5.784 5.784 0 112.85 3.5a5.784 5.784 0 018.18 8.18zm.26 1.12a6.78 6.78 0 11.99-.99l4.18 4.19a.7.7 0 01-.99.99l-4.18-4.19z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</div>\n{%- comment -%} 27 Oct 2026 (Andy): the first box in the Gear & Gallery grid links to The Digital Mint page, in the same card style as the collection boxes. {%- endcomment -%}\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var ul=document.querySelector('.collection-list'); var first=ul&&ul.querySelector('li.collection-list__item'); if(!first||document.getElementById('sc-mint-card')){return;}\n  var li=first.cloneNode(true); li.id='sc-mint-card'; li.style.setProperty('--animation-order','0');\n  li.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(function(a){ a.setAttribute('href','/pages/the-digital-mint'); a.childNodes.forEach(function(n){ if(n.nodeType===3){ n.textContent='The Digital Mint'; } }); });\n  var im=li.querySelector('img'); if(im){ im.removeAttribute('srcset'); im.src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0661/7428/7966/collections/SC_HS_0411.jpg?v=1782724519&width=1500'; im.alt='The Digital Mint'; im.width=1500; im.height=1500; }\n  li.querySelectorAll('.card__caption').forEach(function(p){ var ic=p.querySelector('.icon-wrap'); p.textContent='Original digital artworks from the 1994 Series. One buyer, one owner.'; if(ic){ p.appendChild(ic); } });\n  ul.insertBefore(li,first); ul.className=ul.className.replace(/collection-list--\\d+-items/,function(m){ return 'collection-list--'+(parseInt(m.match(/\\d+/)[0],10)+1)+'-items'; });\n})();\n</script>",
